# DO NOT PRESS SUBMIT — Project Boundaries

This repository is **DO NOT PRESS SUBMIT**, a Chaos Standard browser comedy game.
It is **not** Hallucinated Dungeons. Never import HD requirements, terminology, architecture, prompts, auth, combat, campaigns, DMs, dice, SRD rules, or multiplayer patterns.

## Product boundaries (punch list / reset — hard)

1. Project name is **DO NOT PRESS SUBMIT** — never import Hallucinated Dungeons requirements or architecture.
2. **No runtime LLM / generative AI** — no provider APIs, prompts, chat completions, streaming models, or generative UI.
3. Assistant “intelligence” = **authored dialogue pools** + deterministic player-state (counters, flags, hover/idle/repeat-click, history). Seeded pick among authored variants is allowed.
4. **No auth, multiplayer, accounts**, combat, campaign/RPG engine, or speculative infra.
5. **Visual Vertical Slice + Grade-A presentation** remain top priority over backend.

## No runtime LLM / generative AI

Do **not** implement or reintroduce:
- OpenAI / Anthropic / Gemini / xAI / any LLM provider
- AI provider abstraction, prompt construction/storage, completion or chat endpoints
- `/api/assistant` model paths, streaming model responses, generative UI
- API keys for AI providers, runtime AI decision-making

The Assistant is a **fictional AI character**. Intelligence is an illusion built from:
authored dialogue + variants + personality pools + behavior tracking + counters/flags +
hover/idle/repeat detection + scene state + UI/animation/sound.

Seeded random among authored variants is allowed. Story progression stays deterministic.

## Product identity

- Small mechanical scope, huge presentation (~20–30 min)
- No authentication, accounts, multiplayer, cloud saves, combat, campaigns, RPG engines
- No speculative infrastructure for hypothetical future features
- Visual quality is a primary feature (Grade-A bar) — not a late polish pass
- Prefer: deterministic state + authored content + excellent presentation

## Layout / ambient (player QA)

- Safe layering: form owns center; Assistant bubbles yield (never cover Q/A/choices except intentional Act III gag chaos).
- Ambient eggs must **relocate** on semi-random timings (not opacity-only on fixed anchors).

## Authoritative sources

- Master Build Blueprint v1.1 (visuals, acts, endings, scope) — **live-LLM sections are deleted/superseded**
- Project reset directive / this rule — no runtime LLM; HD boundaries

When stuck: preserve visual quality → keep mechanics simple → keep state deterministic → refuse scope expansion.
